ss_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"dNhuI4zka3WDhbfksalj5w","review_id":"OiY9qZV2_MFwbA-PIBMlHg","date":"2019-01-03T17:44:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9403828382492065,"text_excerpt":"Damn that's some good fried chicken. Eaten here three times in a matter of a day. Those chicken tenders accompanied by a mass amount of alcohol around you is like heaven. Crispy and crunchy on the outside and juicy in the inside. They got like 6 types of sauces on table to use and yes I did make a cocktail of all of the dips and it was bomb. I'll probably eat here an extra 10 times before I go back home. The girl working last night was super nice too. She saw me waiting for my food and went back to check where it was. For me, if you're dealing with Bourbon street peeps all night and can still have any sign of customer service is a ok with me. Keep doing your thing peeps!"},{"business_id":"dNhuI4zka3WDhbfksalj5w","review_id":"E7ZUZ9mjd8-x_-UrftTkGA","date":"2017-02-06T15:42:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9344461560249329,"text_excerpt":"Pretty good fried chicken :) it's all over Nola. Tender and juicy. I believed i saw 3-4 down Bourbon st."},{"business_id":"dNhuI4zka3WDhbfksalj5w","review_id":"c2xj2Gr0q4ES3qWWoa05nw","date":"2017-12-14T15:48:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9221245050430298,"text_excerpt":"Before my friends and I were about to leave New Orleans, we had to stop and get some fried chicken! We looked on Yelp for the best chicken in NOLA and came across Willie's Chicken Shack. We decided to order the regular fried chicken but after placing our order, the waitress brought out chicken tenders? I'm guessing she mistaken our order so we told her the mistake and they quickly prepared the order that we had asked. Honestly, this was probably some of the best fried chicken I had! The skin was super crispy and the meat inside was super tender and juicy as well. It was seasoned perfectly and they even had a bunch of sauces that you can lather your chicken with. I'll definitely stop by Wi..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dNhuI4zka3WDhbfksalj5w","photo_id":"uRQR2cklSgY8wU9EgHIu4Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uRQR2cklSgY8wU9EgHIu4Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9374458193778992},{"business_id":"dNhuI4zka3WDhbfksalj5w","photo_id":"SXDNW2UgixJm0zb_gV4yIg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SXDNW2UgixJm0zb_gV4yIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8782007098197937},{"business_id":"dNhuI4zka3WDhbfksalj5w","photo_id":"kM3Iw514-rBkBu7u3F7pUg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kM3Iw514-rBkBu7u3F7pUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8268483281135559},{"business_id":"dNhuI4zka3WDhbfksalj5w","photo_id":"njD_TdvMAgt6w-t6WGXP_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/njD_TdvMAgt6w-t6WGXP_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7846418023109436},{"business_id":"dNhuI4zka3WDhbfksalj5w","photo_id":"qGrlk7VOP2Go6OaZl8-jMw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qGrlk7VOP2Go6OaZl8-jMw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7629573345184326}]},"notebook_case":null}
